<title>AUSTRALIA: Kidston 1st qtr net loss A$1.69 mln.</title>
<headline>Kidston 1st qtr net loss A$1.69 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 2.64 vs profit 8.38</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 1.69 vs profit 5.37</p>
<p>NOTE: Kidston Gold Mines Ltd is a gold producer and is 70 percent owned by Placer Pacific Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   24.78 vs  32.10</p>
<p>    Other income			   nil  vs   0.32</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 1.4  vs profit 4.3</p>
<p>    Tax					0.95 vs   3.02</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.30 vs   0.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.40 vs   2.77</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
